{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the dreamlike journey of &quot;B&quot;, a pizza delivery rider on her final order of the day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ride through a surreal world, navigating strange landscapes, sudden shifts in scenery, and moments of quiet introspection. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is no ordinary place\u2014it\u2019s a mental space, a liminal realm shared by individuals trapped in a state of limbo. Each corner of this &quot;non-place&quot; reveals stories of unease, instability, and longing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accompanied by her trusty scooter, B must deliver her final pizza while uncovering the mysteries of this enigmatic world. Along the way, connect with its eccentric inhabitants, explore their dreams and regrets, and discover the shared threads that bind them in this surreal, shifting reality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meditative Exploration:</strong> Journey through a strange and captivating world on your trusty Vespa. From beautiful landscapes to liminal spaces, \u201cB\u201d must keep moving forward.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415450/extras/MeditativeExploration_Reduced.gif?t=1740997299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Narrative Experience:</strong> Discover a variety of objects that reveal details about the protagonist and the characters you meet along the way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415450/extras/A_Narrative_Experience_Reduced.gif?t=1740997299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Charming Characters:</strong> Interact with unique individuals to uncover why they inhabit this world. Each has their own dreams, regrets and aspirations. Share a slice of pizza with them to get to know them better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415450/extras/CharmingCharacters_Reduced.gif?t=1740997299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve Puzzles:</strong> Use levers, clay stars, or conveyor belts to solve puzzles and deliver pizza if you want to share it. The choice is yours!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415450/extras/SolvePuzzles_Reduced.gif?t=1740997299\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3415450?t=1740997299","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740997299","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415450/4f3cf52e4d22e0b35ce43c112a9264587ef5c28f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740997299","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415450/4f3cf52e4d22e0b35ce43c112a9264587ef5c28f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740997299","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3452890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the dreamlike journey of &quot;B&quot;, a pizza delivery rider on her final order of the day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ride through a surreal world, navigating strange landscapes, sudden shifts in scenery, and moments of quiet in